 "gates_doc": "Entries with \"after\" (objectives that must be complete), \"until\" (hidden once one of them is complete) or \"choice\" ({objective: choice id | \"!id\"}) are built by registry_level.gd and shown while the condition holds; \"fade\" = seconds of the live cross-fade (instant at load, switch cuts and while the level is hidden). An objective of a scene before the one the level plays counts as complete; inside a memory only those count. c3d_choose (the fire starts in LS_C3_Fire) shows its look only once the level is hidden by the cinematic or the scene is C.",
